IIMMPPLLEEMMEENNTTAATTIIOONN NNOOTTEESS
     This function is not strictly required by an architecture's pmap(9) im‐
     plementation, but it does provide performance benefits if implemented.

     It is intended to eliminate the blast of soft faults on process startup,
     and immediately following a call to mmap(2).

